1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,737
Insight Studio delivers enterprise KPI and BI dashboards in native Odoo 19, without code, external services, or security compromises.

2
00:00:10,737 --> 00:00:16,287
Opening the Sales Executive dashboard reveals an eight-card high-density layout.

3
00:00:16,287 --> 00:00:21,837
Every KPI shows live metrics, period comparisons, and target tracking.

4
00:00:21,837 --> 00:00:31,875
Use compact single-row filters to slice data by date or salesperson, instantly updating trend charts, pipeline funnels, and customer breakdowns.

5
00:00:31,875 --> 00:00:42,137
Click any metric to drill through directly into permitted underlying records, respecting native Odoo access controls and multi-company boundaries.

6
00:00:42,137 --> 00:00:51,637
In customize mode, drag and resize cards on a responsive twelve-column grid, configure measures, and export presentation-ready reports.

7
00:00:51,637 --> 00:00:57,025
Dashboard Studio: governed, fast, and fully native to your Odoo workspace.

